{"identity_key": "bilibili:1270502867973701636", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1270502867973701636", "content": "◤ #Muv-Luv# 系列战术机介绍◢\nMiG-23 Cheburaskha\n\n由米高扬·古列维奇设计局研发的苏联首款纯国产战机。\n\n为赋予MiG-21机动格斗战能力，还引入了在欧洲展现出卓越机动格斗战能力的F-5系列的设计理念。\n虽然采用了将跳跃单元副翼改为可变翼等来自美国技术的设计，但在当时苏联军队的维护体制下，其使用率大幅下降。\n\n在东德，得益于先进的维护技术，该机型得以发挥其潜在性能，并曾由国家安全部武装警察部队使用。", "publisher": "Muv-Luv官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1270502867973701636", "published_at": "2026-11-14T10:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T15:28:00.435009+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/6af62f7af06f15f2566e04c34fb1f41a3546900143802616.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546900143802616", "uid": "3546900143802616", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "◤ #Muv-Luv# 系列战术机介绍◢", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 30, "retweets": 2, "replies": 3}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
